\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Stage~2: continuous interpolated walk. Replacing cardinal steps with Gaussian displacements and adding linear interpolation removes the lattice artefact, producing a realistic-looking trajectory. Step sizes are not yet physically motivated.}}{2}{}}
