\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces The upgraded interactive particle box simulation, shown paused. The large orange particle undergoes Brownian motion driven by elastic collisions with the smaller blue fluid molecules. The right panel shows live sliders for temperature, viscosity, and particle size, real-time diffusion statistics, and a live MSD plot (red: windowed $\langle r^2(\tau )\rangle $; green: linear fit). For this run: $D_{\mathrm  {sim}} = 109.78$\,px$^2$/s and $D\cdot r = 2744.5$\,px$^3$/s at $r = 25$\,px, $T = 300$\,K.}}{5}{}}
